KDE6 port
---------
 * Ported Breeze10 to Plasma 6, KF6, and Qt 6.
 * Split the window decoration and configuration module into separate plugins.
 * Retained X11-only window detection and size-grip behavior when optional XCB support is available.
 * Wayland safely skips X11-only paths.
 * KDE5/Qt5 is no longer supported.
